1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,952
How does a shop that sells in a chat take a card payment, without any website checkout?

2
00:00:04,952 --> 00:00:08,380
The merchant creates a payment link with an amount and a description.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:13,940
The link goes into any chat, and the buyer opens the same bank page as before.

4
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:18,714
A link can be claimed only once, so two buyers can never pay the same order.

5
00:00:18,714 --> 00:00:23,119
Unused links expire after the configured time, and a sweep cleans them up.

6
00:00:23,119 --> 00:00:25,714
Next, sending money back to the buyer.

